
---

### 📄 `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NEXUS CARGO — .gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# --- RUST ---
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
Cargo.lock

# --- BINAIRES DE BUILD ---
nxc
nexus-cargo
*.elf
*.bin

# --- PROJETS DE DÉMO (Créés par le script) ---
demo-hello/
demo-hello/target/

# --- LOGS & TEMP ---
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/

# --- OS & EDITORS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# --- SECRETS ---
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
secrets.json
